            "The three old bachelor rows share this exact official URL. Each is separately audited as a distinct subject under its unchanged full identity hash. A shared guide URL neither merges these records nor blocks a truly different named literature programme. No old Chinese Language and Literature bachelor, name alias or code binding is present. Only the two exact Chinese/English source labels are approved; no Russian translation is invented.",
